  "content_id": "16136177",
  "title": "Google Pay Transaction Issues",
  "description": "Quick help for Google Pay declines across Edge partners. Please find which partner is relevant for your transaction. \nBanxa\nWhy It Might B...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\">Quick help for Google Pay declines across Edge partners. Please find which partner is relevant for your transaction.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Banxa</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why It Might Be Declined:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Unsupported card or region for Google Pay</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Incorrect authorization step</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Bank declined transaction</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>What to Do:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Try a different card in Google Pay</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Use a different payment method</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete KYC</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact Banxa if still stuck</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://support.banxa.com/en/support/tickets/new\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact Banxa Support</b></a><b>: https://support.banxa.com/en/support/tickets/new</b></p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>MoonPay</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why It Might Be Declined:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Insufficient funds or unsupported card</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Google Pay not verified with a 3D Secure card</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Incomplete MoonPay KYC</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Security filters or exceeded limits</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>What to Do:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Use a 3D Secure-enabled card with Google Pay</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete verification on MoonPay</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact your bank</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check MoonPay emails for alerts</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://support.moonpay.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact MoonPay Support</b></a><b>: https://support.moonpay.com/</b></p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Paybis</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why It Might Be Declined:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Risk flagged by Paybis’ system</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Google Pay card not supported for crypto</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Bank rejected the payment</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>What to Do:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Retry after 24 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Try another Google Pay-linked card</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete KYC</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check email from Paybis</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://support.paybis.com/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact Paybis Support</b></a><b>: https://support.paybis.com/</b></p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Simplex</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why It Might Be Declined:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Insufficient funds or invalid card setup</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Google Pay not fully verified</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Bank or Simplex blocked the transaction</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Purchase limits exceeded</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>What to Do:</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Use a valid, verified card in Google Pay</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Finish verification on Simplex</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact your bank</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check for emails from Simplex</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><a href=\"https://www.simplex.com/SUPPORT\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\"><b>Contact Simplex Support</b></a><b>: https://www.simplex.com/SUPPORT</b></p>",
